refactor(core): share orthogonal regions frames boxes and strip intervals

N1b moves actual production geometry into neutral K views without fixation or role metadata. Existing policy code selects obstacles and applies contact, scope, between and support rules after shared interval evaluation. Adds 7 isolated geometry witnesses and a real bridge containment negative control; N1a 13-test suite now links the geometry object too. Static checks pass, runtime validation queued under the shared WSL lock. Document/source/candidate decoupling remains future slices.
